        "id": 238552,
        "name": "Lydia",
        "username": "LadyLagsalot",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/7cd45c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-06-18T15:42:58.236Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi GtG forum.</p>\n<p>I bought a copy of Obliveaeon recently. When looked through Harpy’s deck, I found that I had gotten 3 copies of her character card. “Heh, now it won’t hurt if I loose one,” I thought at first. Then I decided to count her deck and found that it only contained 38 cards. With the help of the Sentinels wiki I found out that they had been put in my deck instead of the two “The Flock’s Care” cards.</p>\n<p>So I have two questions:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>As I am from Denmark, I bought the box from a Danish store. Would I have to take it up with them to get replacement cards, or can I talk to GtG about that?</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Is it still possible to get replacement cards now that the printing of this version of the games has stopped, in favour of the upcoming enhanced edition?</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Thanks in advance.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-06-18T15:42:58.236Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 117,
        "reads": 23,
        "readers_count": 22,
        "score": 589.6,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 28612,
        "topic_slug": "oblivaeon-missing-cards",
        "display_username": "Lydia",
        "primary_group_name": null,
        "flair_name": null,
        "flair_url": null,
        "flair_bg_color": null,
        "flair_color": null,
        "flair_group_id": null,
        "badges_granted": [],
