        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Hi GtG forum.\n\nI bought a copy of Obliveaeon recently. When looked through Harpy's deck, I found that I had gotten 3 copies of her character card. \"Heh, now it won't hurt if I loose one,\" I thought at first. Then I decided to count her deck and found that it only contained 38 cards. With the help of the Sentinels wiki I found out that they had been put in my deck instead of the two \"The Flock's Care\" cards.\n\nSo I have two questions:\n1. As I am from Denmark, I bought the box from a Danish store. Would I have to take it up with them to get replacement cards, or can I talk to GtG about that?\n\n2. Is it still possible to get replacement cards now that the printing of this version of the games has stopped, in favour of the upcoming enhanced edition?\n\nThanks in advance.",
