        "created_at": "2021-06-18T19:45:52.793Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, Greater Than Games will be able to get the cards you need. I wouldn’t use that link, though, as that’s buying the cards and you shouldn’t have to pay even more for something you already paid for. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=9\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\"></p>\n<p>Send a message to <a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a> to let them know your situation and they’ll work with you to get you set up correctly. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1/2.png?v=9\" title=\":+1:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:t2:\"></p>\n<p>And welcome to the community! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
